  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling Serious and Organised Crime in Ghana (SOCG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will seek to reduce the negative impact that SOC has on Ghana&#x2019;s development, by improving governance and raising awareness, commitment and capacity to address it within government, civil society and business. In doing so, it will address direct threats to the UK, and support wider UK security objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
